  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"562\" id=\"isPasted\">ViTAC Solutions is a veteran-owned provider of field-tested first aid and trauma readiness gear. Our lineup includes IFAKs/trauma kits, bleeding control essentials, everyday carry (EDC) medical, and hands-on training built around the Golden Hour principle. Every product is curated by professionals with real-world experience in tactical medicine—so customers get reliable gear, not fluff.</p><h2 data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"591\">What makes us different?</h2><ul data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"1091\"><li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"688\"><p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"688\"><strong data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"625\">Preparedness you can trust:</strong> Kits aligned with TCCC and best-practice first aid guidance.</p></li><li data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"786\"><p data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"786\"><strong data-start=\"691\" data-end=\"719\">Veteran-owned expertise:</strong> Built by instructors and medics who’ve treated real emergencies.</p></li><li data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"871\"><p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"871\"><strong data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"816\">Quality-first curation:</strong> Only proven components—no space-wasters or gimmicks.</p></li><li data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"972\"><p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"972\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"894\">Clear education:</strong> Checklists, training, and how-to content help customers use gear correctly.</p></li><li data-start=\"973\" data-end=\"1091\"><p data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1091\"><strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1002\">Mission-driven service:</strong> Fast support, transparent advice, and gear that’s ready for duty, range, trail, or home.</p></li></ul><h2 data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1120\">How affiliates can earn?</h2><ul data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1469\"><li data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1202\"><p data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1202\"><strong data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1150\">Competitive commissions</strong> on all approved sales (base + performance tiers).</p></li><li data-start=\"1203\" data-end=\"1286\"><p data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1286\"><strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1232\">Upsell-friendly catalog</strong> (kits, refills, tourniquets, training) to lift AOV.</p></li><li data-start=\"1390\" data-end=\"1469\"><p data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1469\"><strong data-start=\"1392\" data-end=\"1419\">30–day cookie window</strong> and approved discount codes to boost conversions.</p></li></ul><blockquote data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1575\"><p data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1575\">If needed, we can match tiering to your audience size and offer custom bundles for high-intent promos.</p></blockquote><h2 data-start=\"1577\" data-end=\"1598\">How to promote us?</h2><ul data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"2457\"><li data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1830\"><p data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1635\"><strong data-start=\"1601\" data-end=\"1633\">Content angles that convert:</strong></p><ul data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1830\"><li data-start=\"1638\" data-end=\"1690\"><p data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1690\">“Build a real IFAK: what to pack, what to skip.”</p></li><li data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1765\"><p data-start=\"1695\" data-end=\"1765\">“Golden Hour: why bleeding control matters in the first 60 minutes.”</p></li><li data-start=\"1768\" data-end=\"1830\"><p data-start=\"1770\" data-end=\"1830\">“Duty/car/trail kits—three loadouts for real emergencies.”</p></li></ul></li><li data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1938\"><p data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1938\"><strong data-start=\"1833\" data-end=\"1855\">Assets we provide:</strong> Product photos, lifestyle images, checklists, spec sheets, and email/swipe copy.</p></li><li data-start=\"1939\" data-end=\"2106\"><p data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"2106\"><strong data-start=\"1941\" data-end=\"1964\">Channels that work:</strong> Review posts, YouTube/shorts demos, IG Reels/TikTok quick tips, preparedness newsletters, Reddit/Forum gear lists (follow community rules).</p></li><li data-start=\"2107\" data-end=\"2250\"><p data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2250\"><strong data-start=\"2109\" data-end=\"2132\">Keywords to target:</strong> first aid kit, IFAK, trauma kit, tourniquet, bleeding control, stop the bleed, EDC medical, emergency preparedness.</p></li></ul><h2 data-start=\"2459\" data-end=\"2480\">Other information</h2><ul data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"3097\"><li data-start=\"2481\" data-end=\"2595\"><p data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2595\"><strong data-start=\"2483\" data-end=\"2504\">Brand guardrails:</strong> No unrealistic medical claims; focus on preparedness, training, and evidence-based gear.</p></li><li data-start=\"2596\" data-end=\"2733\"><p data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2733\"><strong data-start=\"2598\" data-end=\"2615\">Audience fit:</strong> Law enforcement, responsible gun owners, outdoor/adventure, families, workplace safety, church security/volunteers.</p></li><li data-start=\"2734\" data-end=\"2848\"><p data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2848\"><strong data-start=\"2736\" data-end=\"2748\">Support:</strong> Fast affiliate approvals, custom links/codes, UTM guidance, and product Q&amp;A with our instructors.</p></li><li data-start=\"2849\" data-end=\"2993\"><p data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2993\"><strong data-start=\"2851\" data-end=\"2878\">Compliance &amp; platforms:</strong> Facebook/Google/Pinterest-safe messaging available; we avoid political commentary and stick to safety education.</p></li><li data-start=\"2994\" data-end=\"3097\"><p data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3097\"><strong data-start=\"2996\" data-end=\"3021\">Geography &amp; shipping:</strong> U.S.-focused fulfillment; contact us for exceptions or agency partnerships.</p></li></ul></div></div>",
